 "remarks": "Welcome to 53 W. Bank Lane, a spacious Colonial nestled on a desirable cul-de-sac in Stamford's sought-after Westover neighborhood. Set on a beautifully landscaped one-acre property surrounded by mature trees, this inviting home offers privacy, generous living spaces, and wonderful indoor-outdoor living. Offering 3,408 square feet, the home features hardwood floors, abundant natural light, and a comfortable floor plan ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The living room features a classic fireplace, while the spacious family room showcases a striking brick fireplace with wood-burning stove insert and custom built-ins. A dedicated home office provides additional flexibility. The kitchen offers white cabinetry, granite countertops, a breakfast bar, and dining area with sliders to the expansive rear deck. Upstairs, the spacious primary bedroom features a private full bathroom, along with three additional bedrooms and another full bath. The finished lower level offers a recreation area, two bonus rooms, and storage. Outside, enjoy a private backyard retreat featuring a multi-level deck, hot tub, pergola, mature gardens, and picturesque waterfall feature. An attached two-car garage and detached two-car garage provide exceptional four-car parking. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, parks, and major transportation routes, this wonderful property offers the perfect combination of space, privacy, and convenience.",
